       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI99800.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI99800.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Correspondente por data
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI99800         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5805 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
PRA    01  DCLSWPARAM.
PRA        COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF SWPARAM  PREFIX BY 'SWPARAM-'.
PRA   *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV9980.
       COPY SWCV9981.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY VIAW0020.
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                    VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                       VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                       VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                       VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                       VALUE '3'.
PRA   *
PRA        05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01)      VALUE SPACES.
PRA           88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                            VALUE 'S'.
PRA           88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                         VALUE 'N'.
PRA   *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5805                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5805'.
           05 CON-NCCCBCOR                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'NCCCBCOR'.
PRA        05 CON-SWPARAM                   PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-DATA-MAXIMA              PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE
                                                             +99991231.
           05 CON-SEP                      PIC  X(01) VALUE '-'.
           05 CON-PD                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RS                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RS'.
           05 CON-RC                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
PRA        05 WS-PRPARAM               PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
PRA        05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-PRPARAM.
PRA           10 WS-CBANC              PIC  X(04).
PRA           10 WS-CSPAIS             PIC  X(02).
PRA           10 WS-CMOEDA             PIC  X(03).
PRA           10 FILLER                PIC  X(01).
           05 WS-CODEST1               PIC  X(02).
           05 WS-CODEST2               PIC  X(02).
PRA   *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI99800'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-SQL-AUXILIARY.
           05 IND-NULL                  PIC S9(04)    BINARY.
      *
       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 WS-CSEND.
              10 WS-CBAN                PIC  X(04)    VALUE SPACES.
              10 WS-CSPAI               PIC  X(02)    VALUE SPACES.
              10 FILLER                 PIC  X(09)    VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-COUNT                  PIC S9(09)V   COMP-3.
           05 WS-VALOR                  PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
      *
           05 WS-DATVAL-INI             PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE ZEROES.
           05 WS-DATVAL-FIM             PIC S9(08) COMP-3 VALUE ZEROES.
      *
           05 WS-CCONTA                    PIC  X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CCONTA.
              10 WS-CCTA-NCCCBALC          PIC  9(04).
              10 WS-CCTA-SEP               PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-CCTA-NCCCCCB           PIC  X(13).
      *
           05 WS-NCCCBAN                   PIC  X(04) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-NCCCSPAI                  PIC  X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CMOED                     PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-NCCCBALC                  PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05 WS-NCCCCCB                   PIC  X(13) VALUE SPACES.
      *
           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT DATVAL
                 FROM SWVT5805
                WHERE CBAN    = :SWCD5805-CBAN
                  AND CSPAI   = :SWCD5805-CSPAI
                  AND CMOED   = :SWCD5805-CMOED
                  AND DATVAL  BETWEEN :WS-DATVAL-INI
                                  AND :WS-DATVAL-FIM
                  AND DATVAL <= :SWCD5805-DATVAL
                      GROUP BY DATVAL
                      ORDER BY DATVAL DESC
           END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI99800         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV9980-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9980-ASE               TO SWCV9981-ASE.
      *
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9981-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV9981-PAGINA-CHEIA.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9981-INDICE.

           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9981-D-CBAN(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9981-D-CSPAI(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9981-D-CMOED(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
             TO SWCV9981-D-DATVAL(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9981-D-QTMVNR(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9981-D-VLMVNR(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9981-D-QTMVRC(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV9981-D-VLMVRC(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9981-D-CSEND(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV9981-D-CCONTA(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
             TO SWCV9981-D-DDATAI(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
             TO SWCV9981-D-DDATAF(SWCV9981-INDICE).
      *
       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9980-NOMEFXLS           TO SWCV9981-NOMEFXLS.
           MOVE SWCV9980-NMAXLIST           TO SWCV9981-NMAXLIST.
           MOVE SWCV9980-DATVAL-PAG         TO SWCV9981-DATVAL-PAG.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN               TO SWCV9981-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI              TO SWCV9981-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSEND              TO SWCV9981-CSEND.
           MOVE SWCV9980-XDESCCSEND         TO SWCV9981-XDESCCSEND.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CMOED              TO SWCV9981-CMOED.
           MOVE SWCV9980-DATVALI            TO SWCV9981-DATVALI.
           MOVE SWCV9980-DATVALF            TO SWCV9981-DATVALF.
      *
           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9981-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9981-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9981-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9981-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9981-LENGTH
                         - SWCV9981-DIMINUI-LENGTH

                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV9981-CSEND-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV9981-CSEND-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV9981-CSEND-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.


       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.


      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV9980-CSEND NOT EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE SWCV9980-CSEND           TO WS-CSEND
              IF SWCV9980-CBAN EQUAL SPACES
                 MOVE WS-CBAN               TO SWCV9980-CBAN
              END-IF
              IF SWCV9980-CSPAI EQUAL SPACES
                 MOVE WS-CSPAI              TO SWCV9980-CSPAI
              END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN           TO WS-CBAN
               MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI          TO WS-CSPAI
               MOVE WS-CSEND                TO SWCV9980-CSEND
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2020-OBTER-CONTA
              THRU 2029-OBTER-CONTA-EXIT.
      *
PRA        INITIALIZE DCLSWPARAM           REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
PRA                                             ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
PRA   *
PRA        MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN              TO WS-CBANC.
PRA        MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI             TO WS-CSPAIS.
PRA        MOVE SWCV9980-CMOED             TO WS-CMOEDA.
PRA   *
PRA        MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
PRA        MOVE WS-PRPARAM                 TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
PRA   *
PRA        EXEC SQL
PRA           SELECT PRVALBOL
PRA             INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALBOL
PRA             FROM SWPARAM
PRA            WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
PRA              AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
PRA        END-EXEC.
PRA   *
PRA        MOVE CON-SWPARAM                TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
PRA   *
PRA        PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
PRA           THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
PRA   *
PRA        EVALUATE TRUE
PRA           WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
PRA              CONTINUE
PRA           WHEN DB2-OK
PRA              MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALBOL     TO SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS
PRA           WHEN DB2-NOTFND
PRA              SET  SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK    TO TRUE
PRA        END-EVALUATE.
PRA   *
PRA        EVALUATE TRUE
PRA           WHEN NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
PRA           WHEN SW-PRVALBOL-OK
PRA              CONTINUE
PRA           WHEN SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK
PRA              MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
PRA                                        TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
PRA              MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
PRA                                        TO SWCV9981-CSEND-S
PRA              MOVE SWCK0001-CSEND-N-EXISTS
PRA                                        TO SWCV9981-CSEND-MSG
PRA              MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC      TO SWCV9981-CSEND-CAPLIC
PRA        END-EVALUATE.
PRA   *
       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OBTER-CONTA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OBTER-CONTA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OBTER-CONTA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN              TO WS-NCCCBAN.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI             TO WS-NCCCSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CMOED             TO WS-CMOED.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT NCCCBALC
                   , NCCCCCB
                INTO :WS-NCCCBALC
                   , :WS-NCCCCCB
                FROM NCCCBCOR
               WHERE NCCCCBAN      =  :WS-NCCCBAN
                 AND NCCCCSPAI     =  :WS-NCCCSPAI
                 AND NCCCMOED      =  :WS-CMOED
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC
      *
           MOVE CON-NCCCBCOR               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF DB2-OK
              MOVE WS-NCCCBALC             TO WS-CCTA-NCCCBALC
              MOVE CON-SEP                 TO WS-CCTA-SEP
              MOVE WS-NCCCCCB              TO WS-CCTA-NCCCCCB
           END-IF.
      *
       2029-OBTER-CONTA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * PAGINACAO
           IF SWCV9980-DATVAL-PAG EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE VIAK0002-DATA-MAXIMA     TO AQCW0005-DTX10
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9980-DATVAL-PAG      TO AQCW0005-DTX10
           END-IF.

           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.

           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98               TO SWCD5805-DATVAL.

      * FILTRO
           MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN               TO SWCD5805-CBAN.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI              TO SWCD5805-CSPAI.
           MOVE SWCV9980-CMOED              TO SWCD5805-CMOED.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9980-DATVALI            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98               TO WS-DATVAL-INI.
      *
           MOVE CON-DATA-MAXIMA             TO WS-DATVAL-FIM.
           IF SWCV9980-DATVALF NOT EQUAL VIAK0002-DATA-MINIMA
              MOVE SWCV9980-DATVALF         TO AQCW0005-DTX10
              PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
                 THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT
              MOVE AQCW0005-DT98            TO WS-DATVAL-FIM
           END-IF.
      *
           SET SW-CURSOR-NONE TO TRUE


           IF SW-CURSOR-NONE
              SET SW-CURSOR-1 TO TRUE
           END-IF

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        OPEN CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                       FETCH CURSWT01
                        INTO :SWCD5805-DATVAL
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5805               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV9981-INDICE.

           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV9981-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV9981-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV9981-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV9981-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV9981-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV9981-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV9981-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV9981-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV9981-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV9981-LENGTH -
                         SWCV9981-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV9981-INDICE.
      *
           MOVE SWCV9980-CBAN
             TO SWCV9981-D-CBAN(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSPAI
             TO SWCV9981-D-CSPAI(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCV9980-CMOED
             TO SWCV9981-D-CMOED(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD5805-DATVAL             TO AQCW0005-DT98.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10
             TO SWCV9981-D-DATVAL(SWCV9981-INDICE)
                SWCV9981-D-DDATAI(SWCV9981-INDICE)
                SWCV9981-D-DDATAF(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCV9980-CSEND
             TO SWCV9981-D-CSEND(SWCV9981-INDICE).
           MOVE WS-CCONTA
             TO SWCV9981-D-CCONTA(SWCV9981-INDICE).
      *
      * CONTAR E SOMAR NAO RECONCILIADOS
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE CON-PD                  TO WS-CODEST1
              MOVE SPACES                  TO WS-CODEST2

              PERFORM 2060-CONTAR-E-SOMAR
                 THRU 2069-CONTAR-E-SOMAR-EXIT

              MOVE WS-COUNT
                TO SWCV9981-D-QTMVNR(SWCV9981-INDICE)
              MOVE WS-VALOR
                TO SWCV9981-D-VLMVNR(SWCV9981-INDICE)
           END-IF.
      *
      * CONTAR E SOMAR RECONCILIADOS
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE CON-RS                  TO WS-CODEST1
              MOVE CON-RC                  TO WS-CODEST2

              PERFORM 2060-CONTAR-E-SOMAR
                 THRU 2069-CONTAR-E-SOMAR-EXIT

              MOVE WS-COUNT
                TO SWCV9981-D-QTMVRC(SWCV9981-INDICE)
              MOVE WS-VALOR
                TO SWCV9981-D-VLMVRC(SWCV9981-INDICE)
           END-IF.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2060-CONTAR-E-SOMAR
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2060-CONTAR-E-SOMAR.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2060-CONTAR-E-SOMAR' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
                SELECT COUNT(*)
                     , IFNULL(SUM(MVALOR), 0)
                  INTO :WS-COUNT
                     , :WS-VALOR
                  FROM SWVT5805
                 WHERE CBAN    = :SWCD5805-CBAN
                   AND CSPAI   = :SWCD5805-CSPAI
                   AND CMOED   = :SWCD5805-CMOED
                   AND DATVAL  = :SWCD5805-DATVAL
                   AND CCODEST IN (:WS-CODEST1, :WS-CODEST2)
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT5805                TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

            MOVE SPACES                   TO WS-CODEST1
            MOVE SPACES                   TO WS-CODEST2

       2069-CONTAR-E-SOMAR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        CLOSE CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV9980-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9981-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV9980-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV9981-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV9981-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV9981-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV9981-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV9981-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
